text.section:
Each professional nurse appointed to the Board shall:

Be a citizen of the United States of America;


Be a resident of this Commonwealth;


Have been graduated from an educational program approved by a state board of nursing;


Be licensed in this Commonwealth as a registered nurse;


Have had at least five years' experience in nursing, nursing administration or teaching in a nursing education program; and


Have been actively engaged in professional nursing in this Commonwealth for at least three years preceding appointment or reappointment.

Each licensed practical nurse appointed to the Board shall:

Be a citizen of the United States of America;


Be a resident of this Commonwealth;


Have been graduated from a high school or the equivalent;


Have been graduated from a practical nursing program approved by a state board of nursing;


Be licensed in this Commonwealth as a practical nurse;


Have had at least five years' experience in nursing; and


Have been actively engaged in practical nursing in this Commonwealth for at least three years preceding appointment or reappointment.
